 63894                           ;	ZCD Disable bit
 63895                           ;	ZCD = OFF, ZCD module is disabled. ZCD can be enabled by setting the ZCDSEN bit of ZCD
      +                          CON
 63896                           ;	PPSLOCK bit One-Way Set Enable bit
 63897                           ;	PPS1WAY = OFF, PPSLOCKED bit can be set and cleared repeatedly (subject to the unlock 
      +                          sequence)
 63898                           ;	Stack Full/Underflow Reset Enable bit
 63899                           ;	STVREN = ON, Stack full/underflow will cause Reset
 63900                           ;	Low Voltage Programming Enable bit
 63901                           ;	LVP = OFF, HV on MCLR/VPP must be used for programming
 63902                           ;	Extended Instruction Set Enable bit
